## CoolMall / GTR management — local secrets (gitignored)

Copy to `local.properties` next to this file, or use the monorepo root
`local.properties` / `vendor/coolmall-gtr/local.properties`.

```
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YOU\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk

# Live adapters when both set and rpc.forceFake is not true
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Optional: force Fake even when URL+key are set
# rpc.forceFake=true
```

Never commit real keys. Fake adapters run when URL/key blank or `rpc.forceFake=true`.
